{"id":"presente","lemma":"presente","pos":"noun","rank":1108,"glosses":["present, present tense","present (the current moment)","gift, handout"],"ipa":"/pɾeˈsente/","gender":"m","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-presente.wav","examples":[{"text":"No había nadie presente.","en":"No one was present.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524922","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"no one"},null]},{"text":"¿Estabas presente cuando ocurrió el accidente?","en":"Were you there when the accident happened?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/832930","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"when"},{"g":"to happen, to occur","l":"ocurrir"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"accident"}]},{"text":"Deja que te lo presente.","en":"Let me introduce you to him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641878","words":[{"g":"rest"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"it / him"},null]},{"text":"Tendré presente eso.","en":"I'll bear that in mind.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459013","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"Él está presente en la reunión.","en":"He is present at the meeting.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"meeting"}]}]}